snsfeed.c: minimal QMI-over-QRTR client for the Qualcomm Sensor Core
"sns_client" service. It resolves the accel/gyro SUIDs, streams both, applies
gyro bias auto-calibration at rest and feeds the sns_iio IIO bridge
(/dev/sns_iio_feed).

From ROCKNIX: https://github.com/ROCKNIX/distribution/pull/3005
(projects/ROCKNIX/packages/sysutils/odin3-sensors/sources/snsfeed.c at
1a6032db33a056065a373c36745872ca41e1387c), by Anze (DUCKTALE), GPL-2.0.
Unmodified. Protocol notes credit Dylan Van Assche's libssc reverse engineering.
